# Every generation prompt is committed here, named for the asset it produced.
#
# An asset whose prompt is not in this directory does not ship (DECISIONS.md
# D-010). Two reasons: a result without its provenance is not evidence, and a
# style that cannot be regenerated cannot be extended six months from now.
#
# One file per asset. Record the model, the seed, the full prompt, the style
# suffix, and how many candidates were rejected before this one passed the
# mechanical checks.
